/* Authored level hints */
"Panda starts above the bed. Clear the wooden layers without tipping her sideways." = "熊猫就在床的上方。移除一层层木块时，尽量不要让她向两侧倾斜。";
"The wide top plank rests on two sides. Keep its support balanced as you open the middle." = "顶部的宽木板由两侧支撑。清理中间的通道时，注意保持支撑平衡。";
"Panda is above the left side of a wide structure. Focus on the path beneath her rather than clearing every block." = "熊猫位于整个宽支架的左上方。重点清理她下方的通道，不必移除所有木块。";
"Panda starts to the right of the bed. Think about how the overlapping planks can bring her toward the center." = "熊猫从床的右上方出发。想一想，交叠的木板怎样才能把她引向中间。";
"The square blocks form an offset stack. Removing a lower block changes the balance of everything above it." = "方块错位堆叠在一起。移除下层方块会改变上方所有物体的平衡。";
"Panda starts on the left. The two narrow supports under her top block can change which way she leans." = "熊猫从左侧出发。顶部方块下的两根窄支柱会影响她倾斜的方向。";
"Panda rests on the high right plank. The lower planks can help her descend toward the bed." = "熊猫在右侧较高的木板上。下方的木板可以帮助她朝床的方向下降。";
"The top block rests on upright planks. Watch how removing one support changes the block's balance." = "顶部方块由竖直木板支撑。留意移除一侧支撑后，方块的平衡会怎样变化。";
"Panda starts far to the left of the bed. A straight drop may miss; use the supporting plank to guide her inward." = "熊猫离床的左侧很远。直接落下可能会错过床，试着用支撑木板引导她向中间移动。";
"The gray stone pieces move as one structure. Clear a landing path before removing that support." = "灰色石块会作为一个整体移动。移除这组支撑前，先清理好落向床的通道。";
"Panda starts on the right. Compare the two narrow supports before choosing which side to release." = "熊猫从右侧出发。先比较两根窄支柱，再决定从哪一侧开始移除。";
"Panda rests on the high left plank. Use the lower planks to guide her toward the bed." = "熊猫在左侧较高的木板上。利用下方木板引导她朝床的方向移动。";
"Panda starts far to the right of the bed. Think about the direction the long plank will tilt." = "熊猫离床的右侧很远。想一想，长木板会朝哪个方向倾斜。";
"Clear the wooden block above the bed, then remove the top plank." = "先移除床上方的木块，再移除顶部木板。";
"Clear the center block, then remove the upper plank. Let Panda settle before removing the lower plank." = "先移除中间的木块，再移除上层木板。等熊猫平稳后，再移除下层木板。";
"Clear the wooden blocks above the bed first. The stone bridge disappears as one piece when tapped." = "先移除床上方的木块。点击石桥时，所有石块会一起消失。";

